# IslandActivity: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandActivity.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ipc timer toggle
ipc timer stopwatch
wait 1
ptr move 1500 600
rec rows-in 1.5 ptr glide 960 14 300
note rows fade and rise 8 px in, 45 ms apart (280 ms OutCubic each)
shot rows
note timer row: "Focus", "24:5x left", progress line, pause + skip (no reset); stopwatch row: lap + pause
ptr glide 1150 90 300
ptr click
wait 2
shot timer-paused
note the timer row's icon is now play and its time stopped
ipc timer reset
ipc timer stopwatchReset
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1

look glass
ipc timer toggle
ipc timer stopwatch
wait 1
ptr move 1500 600
rec rows-in 1.5 ptr glide 960 14 300
note rows fade and rise 8 px in, 45 ms apart (280 ms OutCubic each)
shot rows
note timer row: "Focus", "24:5x left", progress line, pause + skip (no reset); stopwatch row: lap + pause
ptr glide 1150 90 300
ptr click
wait 2
shot timer-paused
note the timer row's icon is now play and its time stopped
ipc timer reset
ipc timer stopwatchReset
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
